invariant: INV-4
file: srv_flight.c
catches: test/lint-invariants.sh
reason: srv_send_server_hello draws its random twice. The second call is a
  new site inside a file that already holds two admitted ones, so the
  files rule passes it, and nobody audited what it draws or why. The
  calls rule refuses a second call in any function that holds one.

--- old
    ch_rand_bytes(random32, sizeof random32);
--- new
    ch_rand_bytes(random32, sizeof random32);
    ch_rand_bytes(random32, sizeof random32);
